1
00:00:00,310 --> 00:00:01,940
(All people, incidents,
and backgrounds...)

2
00:00:02,010 --> 00:00:03,210
(in this drama are fictitious
and unrelated to reality.)

3
00:00:03,270 --> 00:00:05,280
(Also, children were filmed
under production guidelines.)

4
00:00:12,980 --> 00:00:14,290
(Episode 2)

5
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:22,760
What the...

6
00:00:59,700 --> 00:01:01,330
I wanted to apologize for last time.

7
00:01:01,400 --> 00:01:03,640
Can you meet me at the convenience store
by the school?

8
00:01:03,740 --> 00:01:04,800
I'll be waiting.

9
00:01:06,370 --> 00:01:07,410
Well, that was random.

10
00:01:26,160 --> 00:01:31,100
(Lacquer Thinner)

11
00:01:46,140 --> 00:01:49,150
If I can't enter the competition,
neither can you.

12
00:01:49,980 --> 00:01:50,980
That's the only way it's fair.

13
00:02:15,540 --> 00:02:17,880
Three, two, one.

14
00:02:18,940 --> 00:02:20,810
All right, time to dig in.

15
00:02:27,690 --> 00:02:28,690
Nice.

16
00:02:42,870 --> 00:02:43,870
Ko Eun Seol?

17
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:51,940
Hae Ra,
I'm at the convenience store.

18
00:02:51,940 --> 00:02:52,940
Where are you?

19
00:02:53,180 --> 00:02:54,180
Sorry,

20
00:02:54,180 --> 00:02:56,310
my mom caught me on my way out,
so I couldn't make it.

21
00:02:57,150 --> 00:02:58,150
I'll see you tomorrow.

22
00:02:58,520 --> 00:02:59,580
What?

23
00:03:00,180 --> 00:03:02,350
Hey, Hae Ra. Kang Hae Ra!

24
00:03:07,630 --> 00:03:09,030
Unbelievable.

25
00:03:38,920 --> 00:03:39,920
Boo!

26
00:03:41,430 --> 00:03:42,490
Ko Eun Seol,
what are you doing here?

27
00:03:44,060 --> 00:03:45,960
Don't tell me
you've been painting this late.

28
00:03:46,730 --> 00:03:48,600
I have a deadline coming up soon.

29
00:03:53,740 --> 00:03:55,370
Have you eaten yet?

30
00:03:56,010 --> 00:03:57,280
Can I get you something? My treat.

31
00:03:57,840 --> 00:03:59,640
Why would you? No, I'm good.

32
00:04:00,210 --> 00:04:01,210
Did I...

33
00:04:02,180 --> 00:04:03,550
Did I do something wrong?

34
00:04:06,020 --> 00:04:09,020
It feels like you're avoiding me,
so I was wondering if I upset you.

35
00:04:09,790 --> 00:04:10,960
It's not like that.

36
00:04:11,320 --> 00:04:12,320
Then why are you acting like this?

37
00:04:13,560 --> 00:04:14,560
What do you mean?

38
00:04:15,190 --> 00:04:16,190
I should get going.

39
00:04:16,960 --> 00:04:18,260
Ko Eun Seol. Hey...

40
00:04:29,910 --> 00:04:31,580
Wait. My painting.

41
00:04:38,750 --> 00:04:40,320
This is Midong High School.

42
00:04:40,650 --> 00:04:42,350
There's a fire.
Please help, quickly.

43
00:04:52,730 --> 00:04:53,730
Darn.

44
00:05:14,890 --> 00:05:17,160
I'm going to get an answer today...

45
00:05:17,860 --> 00:05:19,360
about why she's avoiding me.

46
00:05:20,690 --> 00:05:21,690
Right.

47
00:05:24,560 --> 00:05:25,560
What's that? A fire?

48
00:05:30,840 --> 00:05:32,340
Is anyone there?

49
00:05:33,370 --> 00:05:34,510
Help...

50
00:05:46,080 --> 00:05:47,790
Ko Eun Seol. Hey!

51
00:05:48,820 --> 00:05:50,590
Ko Eun Seol!

52
00:05:51,090 --> 00:05:54,160
Help. Somebody help.

53
00:05:54,560 --> 00:05:55,660
Please help...

54
00:05:59,300 --> 00:06:00,300
Eun Seol.

55
00:06:01,500 --> 00:06:02,500
Eun Seol!

56
00:06:05,670 --> 00:06:07,170
Eun Seol, wake up.

57
00:06:08,340 --> 00:06:09,340
Ko Eun Seol!

58
00:06:57,760 --> 00:06:59,060
I need some help over here!

59
00:06:59,660 --> 00:07:01,690
- Over here!
- Yes, what is it?

60
00:07:01,690 --> 00:07:03,260
I think a glass shard cut her neck.

61
00:07:03,260 --> 00:07:04,460
She's lost a lot of blood.

62
00:07:04,530 --> 00:07:05,800
Okay. First, lay her down.

63
00:07:07,470 --> 00:07:08,470
I'm lifting her legs.

64
00:07:10,330 --> 00:07:12,170
Let's run a blood test first.

65
00:07:16,970 --> 00:07:19,080
(Emergency Room)

66
00:07:23,550 --> 00:07:24,950
Eun Seol, are you okay?

67
00:07:27,220 --> 00:07:29,090
What's wrong with my daughter?

68
00:07:29,690 --> 00:07:31,960
Is she badly hurt?
Where? How bad is it?

69
00:07:32,190 --> 00:07:33,390
Are you the patient's mother?

70
00:07:33,690 --> 00:07:35,360
Yes, I'm her mom.

71
00:07:35,660 --> 00:07:36,690
Is she okay?

72
00:07:36,830 --> 00:07:37,960
She'll be okay, right, Doctor?

73
00:07:38,160 --> 00:07:39,900
Your daughter's lost a lot of blood,

74
00:07:40,100 --> 00:07:41,400
so she'll need a transfusion.

75
00:07:41,570 --> 00:07:42,900
Then please do it right away,
Doctor.

76
00:07:43,330 --> 00:07:46,140
I'm afraid our hospital
is currently out of blood.

77
00:07:46,270 --> 00:07:49,310
Is there a family member
who's able to donate blood?

78
00:07:49,370 --> 00:07:52,610
I can. I'll do it.
I'm Eun Seol's older brother.

79
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:54,450
You're Type A RH-negative, right?

80
00:07:54,880 --> 00:07:57,280
What? No. I'm Type O.

81
00:07:57,350 --> 00:07:59,220
Then you can't.

82
00:08:00,320 --> 00:08:02,820
What about the mother?
Ma'am, what's your blood type?

83
00:08:02,890 --> 00:08:05,390
There must be a mistake
with the test, Doctor.

84
00:08:06,020 --> 00:08:08,830
My mom is Type O,
and our whole family is Type O.

85
00:08:09,390 --> 00:08:10,700
Right, Mom?

86
00:08:13,530 --> 00:08:14,530
Mom?

87
00:08:15,900 --> 00:08:16,900
What?

88
00:08:18,600 --> 00:08:20,440
Can't you get some
from another hospital?

89
00:08:20,710 --> 00:08:24,080
Doctor, please save my daughter.
Please. I'm begging you.

90
00:08:26,680 --> 00:08:28,380
You have no blood for her?

91
00:08:29,210 --> 00:08:31,850
A-negative blood is very rare.

92
00:08:32,150 --> 00:08:34,320
We're trying to find some,
but it's not easy.

93
00:08:35,920 --> 00:08:36,920
But...

94
00:08:55,710 --> 00:08:58,510
(Emergency Medical Center)

95
00:09:00,780 --> 00:09:02,910
Urgent need for A-negative blood.

96
00:09:03,550 --> 00:09:04,850
Please help.

97
00:09:05,350 --> 00:09:08,090
The number is 010-0198-1105.

98
00:09:08,790 --> 00:09:11,460
I have to spread the word.
Where else can I post this?

99
00:09:15,230 --> 00:09:16,230
Hello?

100
00:09:16,290 --> 00:09:19,500
Are you the person
who posted about needing blood?

101
00:09:19,700 --> 00:09:21,070
Can you donate?

102
00:09:35,150 --> 00:09:36,550
- Are you Blood Bank?
- Yes, that's me.

103
00:09:36,610 --> 00:09:37,620
Hop on.

104
00:09:38,850 --> 00:09:40,650
Let's go. Hold on tight.

105
00:09:54,600 --> 00:09:55,600
Hey.

106
00:09:56,100 --> 00:09:58,740
What happened?
Is Eun Seol all right?

107
00:09:59,240 --> 00:10:00,740
She lost a lot of blood,

108
00:10:01,170 --> 00:10:03,140
but she got a transfusion
and pulled through.

109
00:10:04,380 --> 00:10:06,310
That's a relief. Thank goodness.

110
00:10:07,880 --> 00:10:08,880
But, Father...

111
00:10:09,410 --> 00:10:11,380
- What is it?
- It's about Eun Seol.

112
00:10:11,520 --> 00:10:12,520
What about her?

113
00:10:14,750 --> 00:10:16,290
Forget it. It's nothing.

114
00:10:16,620 --> 00:10:17,620
What?

115
00:10:18,190 --> 00:10:19,590
Eun Guk, you're back.

116
00:10:20,830 --> 00:10:22,860
Eun Seol has pulled through, Mom.

117
00:10:23,290 --> 00:10:26,760
She's nothing but trouble
for this family.

118
00:10:27,200 --> 00:10:29,630
I knew it ever since
she was born premature.

119
00:10:29,700 --> 00:10:31,200
Mom, how can you say that...

120
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:33,270
to someone who's lying injured
in a hospital?

121
00:10:33,340 --> 00:10:35,340
Don't you know things went downhill
after she was born?

122
00:10:36,010 --> 00:10:37,310
Your father died,

123
00:10:37,380 --> 00:10:39,640
and every business
you've started has failed.

124
00:10:39,810 --> 00:10:43,650
How is any of that Eun Seol's fault?
Father was sick long before that.

125
00:10:44,180 --> 00:10:45,450
And my businesses failed...

126
00:10:46,020 --> 00:10:47,690
because of my own shortcomings.

127
00:10:47,750 --> 00:10:50,390
If you don't know what
you're talking about, just be quiet.

128
00:10:50,490 --> 00:10:52,260
Do you know
what the fortune teller said?

129
00:10:52,520 --> 00:10:55,790
She said Eun Seol's fortune
clashes with ours.

130
00:10:55,860 --> 00:10:57,500
That's why our family is ruined.

131
00:10:59,360 --> 00:11:00,500
That's ridiculous.

132
00:11:00,530 --> 00:11:02,100
What? I know I'm right.

133
00:11:36,700 --> 00:11:38,800
Sweetheart, what's wrong?

134
00:11:39,470 --> 00:11:41,640
Doctor, please check on my baby.

135
00:11:41,710 --> 00:11:43,540
Something's wrong
with my baby, Doctor.

136
00:11:46,540 --> 00:11:47,850
Her oxygen levels are dropping.

137
00:11:47,910 --> 00:11:49,450
Her heart rate is
at a dangerous level.

138
00:11:49,710 --> 00:11:51,720
All her vitals are way too low,
Doctor.

139
00:11:52,050 --> 00:11:53,420
Check her airway
and prepare for intubation.

140
00:11:53,480 --> 00:11:54,490
- Hurry.
- Got it.

141
00:12:14,470 --> 00:12:15,470
Mom...

142
00:12:18,680 --> 00:12:20,780
Hey. Are you awake?

143
00:12:21,050 --> 00:12:22,080
Have you come to?

144
00:12:22,810 --> 00:12:23,810
Yes.

145
00:12:24,580 --> 00:12:26,920
Oh, good.
You're going to be all right.

146
00:12:27,320 --> 00:12:28,320
But...

147
00:12:28,490 --> 00:12:29,650
Where am I?

148
00:12:30,590 --> 00:12:32,720
Where do you think? The hospital.

149
00:12:34,260 --> 00:12:36,430
Don't you remember
what happened yesterday?

150
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:41,030
So...

151
00:12:41,900 --> 00:12:43,230
Was the fire put out?

152
00:12:44,700 --> 00:12:45,700
Yes.

153
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:47,000
But...

154
00:12:47,300 --> 00:12:49,140
what happened?

155
00:12:51,040 --> 00:12:53,040
Did you do it?

156
00:12:54,610 --> 00:12:55,680
No.

157
00:12:56,210 --> 00:12:57,950
What do you mean, no?

158
00:12:58,020 --> 00:12:59,550
Who else but Ko Eun Seol
could've done it?

159
00:12:59,720 --> 00:13:01,390
She was the only one left
in the art room.

160
00:13:01,450 --> 00:13:03,090
Plus, she reported it herself.

161
00:13:03,220 --> 00:13:04,520
Doesn't that say it all?

162
00:13:04,990 --> 00:13:06,720
So what's going to happen
to Ko Eun Seol now?

163
00:13:06,790 --> 00:13:08,730
What do you think will happen?

164
00:13:08,890 --> 00:13:10,900
She'll probably get expelled
and her life will be over.

165
00:13:12,060 --> 00:13:13,160
Right, Hae Ra?

166
00:13:13,830 --> 00:13:15,330
Why are you asking
such an obvious question?

167
00:13:16,070 --> 00:13:18,700
I guess we'll find out the truth
from the CCTV footage.

168
00:13:20,070 --> 00:13:21,310
The CCTV footage?

169
00:13:22,140 --> 00:13:23,240
From where?

170
00:13:23,310 --> 00:13:25,110
There's a camera in the hallway.

171
00:13:25,340 --> 00:13:27,280
I heard the teachers are going
to check the footage.

172
00:13:29,510 --> 00:13:31,150
Kang Hae Ra, your homeroom teacher
wants to see you.

173
00:13:32,120 --> 00:13:33,180
Me? Why?

174
00:13:33,280 --> 00:13:35,020
I don't know. You're being called
to the counselor's office.

175
00:13:41,890 --> 00:13:42,890
Come in.

176
00:13:48,470 --> 00:13:49,570
May I help you?

177
00:13:51,270 --> 00:13:54,000
Hello. I'm Kang Hae Ra's guardian.

178
00:13:54,670 --> 00:13:58,240
I thought Hae Ra's mother was
the actress Kim Jung Sun.

179
00:13:58,610 --> 00:14:01,980
I manage their household affairs.
I'm here in her place.

180
00:14:02,380 --> 00:14:04,380
(Joo Mi Ran)

181
00:14:04,780 --> 00:14:07,920
I heard you were looking for Hae Ra.
What's this about?

182
00:14:08,320 --> 00:14:09,590
You've come at a good time.

183
00:14:09,690 --> 00:14:11,660
We were just about
to call her parents.

184
00:14:12,060 --> 00:14:14,060
Here, please have a seat.

185
00:14:26,100 --> 00:14:27,640
You recognize her, don't you?

186
00:14:29,070 --> 00:14:31,280
It's Hae Ra. Kang Hae Ra.

187
00:14:32,810 --> 00:14:35,250
I'd like to speak
with the Vice Principal alone,

188
00:14:35,710 --> 00:14:36,980
so please give us the room.

189
00:14:37,050 --> 00:14:38,450
I'm Hae Ra's homeroom teacher.

190
00:14:39,150 --> 00:14:40,320
Vice Principal Hwang?

191
00:14:42,220 --> 00:14:43,220
Of course.

192
00:14:43,950 --> 00:14:45,520
Ms. Jung,
please get back to your work.

193
00:14:45,860 --> 00:14:46,920
But sir...

194
00:14:47,090 --> 00:14:48,360
Go on.

195
00:15:01,710 --> 00:15:02,710
Please go ahead.

196
00:15:03,340 --> 00:15:06,210
Did you have something
to say to me privately?

197
00:15:06,940 --> 00:15:08,150
The CCTV footage.

198
00:15:09,350 --> 00:15:10,710
Did you hand it over to the police?

199
00:15:11,150 --> 00:15:12,450
No, not yet.

200
00:15:13,420 --> 00:15:14,590
Why do you ask?

201
00:15:16,050 --> 00:15:17,760
Then please erase it.

202
00:15:19,060 --> 00:15:20,890
I'll guarantee your promotion
to principal.

203
00:15:26,160 --> 00:15:28,630
(Vice Principal Hwang Joo Hyung)

204
00:15:31,270 --> 00:15:33,140
This is ridiculous.
Just pretend I didn't see it?

205
00:15:33,200 --> 00:15:35,910
How can I?
It's right there on camera.

206
00:15:36,310 --> 00:15:37,980
Caught on camera?

207
00:15:38,040 --> 00:15:39,440
What are you talking about?

208
00:15:39,540 --> 00:15:40,710
Sir!

209
00:15:41,210 --> 00:15:42,910
Did you erase the footage?

210
00:15:44,050 --> 00:15:46,380
I'll take care of this matter,

211
00:15:46,880 --> 00:15:49,290
so you just focus
on your classes, Ms. Jung.

212
00:15:49,950 --> 00:15:51,720
And stop spreading needless rumors.

213
00:15:51,960 --> 00:15:54,020
- Sir!
- Ms. Jung.

214
00:15:56,360 --> 00:15:57,560
You're up for a full-time position.

215
00:15:58,200 --> 00:15:59,360
Should I cancel that?

216
00:16:02,100 --> 00:16:04,540
(How to Be a Kind Leader)

217
00:16:04,600 --> 00:16:06,440
Mr. Kang, you're home early.

218
00:16:06,600 --> 00:16:08,240
Right. Did you go out?

219
00:16:08,440 --> 00:16:11,110
Yes, I had something
to take care of.

220
00:16:11,680 --> 00:16:12,840
Where's Ms. Kim?

221
00:16:12,940 --> 00:16:13,940
In her room.

222
00:16:14,310 --> 00:16:15,310
That reminds me.

223
00:16:15,810 --> 00:16:17,750
Manager Joo,
go in and try to console her.

224
00:16:17,750 --> 00:16:20,280
She's sulking in there
because she didn't get cast.

225
00:16:22,020 --> 00:16:23,020
Yes, sir.

226
00:16:33,600 --> 00:16:35,630
What happened, Ms. Kim?

227
00:16:37,570 --> 00:16:39,340
Why didn't you get the part?

228
00:16:42,070 --> 00:16:43,840
Why do you think?

229
00:16:44,410 --> 00:16:46,380
It's because I'm a has-been.

230
00:16:48,250 --> 00:16:51,010
So? Who got the part instead?

231
00:16:51,920 --> 00:16:53,120
Lee Sun Joo.

232
00:16:54,080 --> 00:16:57,150
I wanted to go out on a high note
with this last project,

233
00:16:57,490 --> 00:16:59,320
but things never go
the way you want.

234
00:17:01,590 --> 00:17:04,430
I'll talk
to the production company again.

235
00:17:06,830 --> 00:17:08,870
You think talking to them
will change anything?

236
00:17:09,100 --> 00:17:10,730
Don't give me false hope.

237
00:17:11,670 --> 00:17:14,040
Have I ever made you
an empty promise?

238
00:17:15,040 --> 00:17:17,740
Just trust me
and get ready for the role.

239
00:17:29,620 --> 00:17:30,620
It's me.

240
00:17:32,390 --> 00:17:35,530
The actress, Lee Sun Joo.
Dig up some dirt on her.

241
00:17:36,590 --> 00:17:38,430
If there isn't any, make some up.

242
00:17:41,330 --> 00:17:43,170
(Hospital Room)

243
00:18:10,030 --> 00:18:11,900
The weather is so nice.

244
00:18:17,270 --> 00:18:20,340
You saved my life.
Thank you so much.

245
00:18:23,140 --> 00:18:25,240
If you're that grateful,
you can buy me a meal.

246
00:18:30,550 --> 00:18:33,920
By the way, why did you come back
to the school that day?

247
00:18:35,290 --> 00:18:36,890
Oh, that? Well...

248
00:18:38,090 --> 00:18:42,560
I was going to confront you
about why you've been avoiding me.

249
00:18:44,830 --> 00:18:48,000
When did I ever do that?
I've never done that.

250
00:18:49,570 --> 00:18:50,800
Yes, you have.

251
00:18:51,030 --> 00:18:52,540
I'm telling you, I haven't.

252
00:18:55,540 --> 00:18:56,570
Are you...

253
00:18:58,310 --> 00:18:59,880
interested in me by any chance?

254
00:19:01,850 --> 00:19:05,350
Wait, what?
What are you talking about?

255
00:19:06,950 --> 00:19:08,750
It's not like that at all.

256
00:19:09,620 --> 00:19:11,090
Then why are you stuttering?

257
00:19:12,820 --> 00:19:14,460
Are you really interested in me?

258
00:19:15,190 --> 00:19:17,560
Seriously.
I told you it's not like that.

259
00:19:19,500 --> 00:19:21,370
Hey, don't forget your flowers.

260
00:19:35,680 --> 00:19:37,280
Well, I'm interested in you.

261
00:19:38,350 --> 00:19:39,350
So...

262
00:19:40,480 --> 00:19:42,490
it's okay for you
to be interested in me too.

263
00:19:45,490 --> 00:19:47,090
I told you it's not like that.

264
00:19:47,260 --> 00:19:48,630
Just give me the flowers.

265
00:19:53,900 --> 00:19:55,830
Get well soon.
I'll see you at school.

266
00:20:10,380 --> 00:20:12,820
There must be a mistake
with the test, Doctor.

267
00:20:13,020 --> 00:20:15,890
My mom is Type O,
and our whole family is Type O.

268
00:20:17,750 --> 00:20:18,890
Honey, you're home.

269
00:20:23,690 --> 00:20:25,230
I came for Eun Seol's things.

270
00:20:25,230 --> 00:20:26,730
- Right.
- And your mother?

271
00:20:26,730 --> 00:20:27,930
She's asleep.

272
00:20:28,100 --> 00:20:30,170
- Is Eun Guk asleep too?
- Yes.

273
00:20:33,440 --> 00:20:34,440
You're home.

274
00:20:35,710 --> 00:20:36,810
I see you're awake.

275
00:20:37,810 --> 00:20:40,640
Could you come over to our room
for a minute?

276
00:20:41,850 --> 00:20:44,080
Do you have something to say to him?

277
00:20:51,220 --> 00:20:53,660
What is it? Why the serious face?

278
00:20:53,720 --> 00:20:58,060
Is it something serious?
Then I'll step out.

279
00:20:58,160 --> 00:20:59,960
This is something
you know about too.

280
00:21:02,170 --> 00:21:03,470
Father knows about this too?

281
00:21:04,940 --> 00:21:06,240
What do I know?

282
00:21:07,670 --> 00:21:08,710
Eun Seol...

283
00:21:09,210 --> 00:21:10,210
What about her?

284
00:21:12,240 --> 00:21:13,310
Wait.

285
00:21:13,880 --> 00:21:15,880
Why are you suddenly
bringing that up?

286
00:21:16,950 --> 00:21:18,520
Because Eun Guk found out.

287
00:21:18,580 --> 00:21:21,990
Wait, so you're saying
Eun Seol isn't my real sister?

288
00:21:22,090 --> 00:21:25,260
Keep your voice down!
You'll wake your grandmother.

289
00:21:27,360 --> 00:21:28,460
Grandma doesn't know?

290
00:21:29,360 --> 00:21:30,590
Of course not.

291
00:21:31,190 --> 00:21:34,400
Do you think she would've
let us raise her if she'd known?

292
00:21:35,970 --> 00:21:37,970
Tell me everything
from the beginning.

293
00:21:38,470 --> 00:21:40,170
How did it come to this?

294
00:21:42,310 --> 00:21:44,880
You know Eun Seol
was born prematurely, right?

295
00:21:45,540 --> 00:21:47,840
Yes, Grandma told me.

296
00:21:48,210 --> 00:21:51,620
But that baby didn't make it.

297
00:21:53,450 --> 00:21:54,990
She died.

298
00:21:57,190 --> 00:21:59,160
Then who's Eun Seol?

299
00:22:01,220 --> 00:22:02,860
The daughter
of your mother's friend.

300
00:22:02,960 --> 00:22:06,600
Wait, why would you raise
her friend's daughter?

301
00:22:08,000 --> 00:22:10,370
The day your sister passed away,

302
00:22:11,400 --> 00:22:12,900
I ran into...

303
00:22:13,700 --> 00:22:15,570
an old friend from high school
outside the hospital.

304
00:22:19,640 --> 00:22:23,350
(17 years ago)

305
00:22:33,160 --> 00:22:34,320
Are you all right?

306
00:22:35,060 --> 00:22:36,590
Where are you hurt?

307
00:22:37,330 --> 00:22:39,300
Please, you have to help me.

308
00:22:43,500 --> 00:22:44,740
Ae Sook...

309
00:22:45,540 --> 00:22:46,840
Aren't you Ae Sook?

310
00:22:47,040 --> 00:22:49,810
Joo Ae Sook
from Yeongsu High, right?

311
00:22:50,140 --> 00:22:51,980
Park Hee Jung?

312
00:22:52,040 --> 00:22:55,680
Oh, you remember me.
But what's wrong?

313
00:22:55,680 --> 00:22:57,050
Why are you in so much pain?

314
00:22:57,350 --> 00:22:59,650
The baby... The baby's coming.

315
00:23:00,120 --> 00:23:03,690
What? My goodness.
Let's get you to the hospital.

316
00:23:04,190 --> 00:23:05,190
Watch your step.

317
00:23:09,330 --> 00:23:14,100
(Taeseon Hospital)

318
00:23:19,840 --> 00:23:26,140
(Delivery Room)

319
00:23:26,210 --> 00:23:27,340
It's a girl.

320
00:23:31,350 --> 00:23:32,650
She's so beautiful.

321
00:23:39,790 --> 00:23:42,860
(Injection Room)

322
00:23:42,930 --> 00:23:45,630
The mother, Joo Ae Sook,
left her baby and disappeared.

323
00:23:45,830 --> 00:23:48,770
If she doesn't return,
the baby might be sent to a shelter.

324
00:24:09,820 --> 00:24:12,460
(Mother's Name: Joo Ae Sook)

325
00:24:17,430 --> 00:24:19,260
(Mother's Name: Joo Ae Sook)

326
00:24:19,330 --> 00:24:21,360
She just abandoned
her baby like that?

327
00:24:22,800 --> 00:24:24,800
And you took her in
and raised her as Eun Seol?

328
00:24:25,500 --> 00:24:26,500
Yes.

329
00:24:27,140 --> 00:24:28,640
In place of the baby we lost,

330
00:24:28,710 --> 00:24:30,470
she felt like a gift from above.

331
00:24:32,110 --> 00:24:33,610
What did I just hear?

332
00:24:33,880 --> 00:24:35,680
- Mother.
- Mom...

333
00:24:35,780 --> 00:24:39,820
Are you saying Eun Seol
is a kid you picked up?

334
00:24:40,250 --> 00:24:41,990
No, that's not it.

335
00:24:41,990 --> 00:24:44,960
What do you mean, no?
I heard it loud and clear.

336
00:24:45,090 --> 00:24:47,690
Mother, please calm down
and hear me out.

337
00:24:47,760 --> 00:24:49,090
What more is there to hear?

338
00:24:49,490 --> 00:24:50,990
I don't want to hear it.

339
00:24:50,990 --> 00:24:53,660
Get her out of here as soon
as she's discharged. Got it?

340
00:24:53,730 --> 00:24:54,730
Mother.

341
00:24:55,230 --> 00:24:57,770
You'll keep raising her when
you don't know who the father is?

342
00:24:57,770 --> 00:24:59,070
She's nothing but trouble!

343
00:24:59,070 --> 00:25:01,610
Grandma, how could you say
something so cruel?

344
00:25:01,940 --> 00:25:03,410
I told you, didn't I?

345
00:25:03,840 --> 00:25:05,540
She's the reason
your grandfather died...

346
00:25:05,610 --> 00:25:07,540
and your father's business failed.

347
00:25:08,510 --> 00:25:11,110
I made myself clear. Get her out.

348
00:25:16,820 --> 00:25:18,090
What do we do now, honey?

349
00:25:34,640 --> 00:25:37,140
Mom, is something wrong?

350
00:25:37,810 --> 00:25:38,810
What?

351
00:25:39,080 --> 00:25:41,410
You've just seemed down for a while.

352
00:25:42,680 --> 00:25:44,010
Is it because of me?

353
00:25:45,220 --> 00:25:48,320
I'm not in any pain anymore.
You don't have to worry.

354
00:25:51,190 --> 00:25:53,460
Okay. I won't worry.

355
00:25:53,860 --> 00:25:55,090
Hello.

356
00:25:55,790 --> 00:25:59,960
Here are the discharge papers
and the bill for you to settle.

357
00:26:00,560 --> 00:26:01,600
Right.

358
00:26:06,900 --> 00:26:08,510
I'm going to run downstairs
for a minute.

359
00:26:08,710 --> 00:26:09,710
Sure.

360
00:26:18,080 --> 00:26:19,550
(Seohan Hospital)

361
00:26:26,190 --> 00:26:28,090
(Patient Information Notice:
Ko Eun Seol)

362
00:26:36,200 --> 00:26:37,530
A blood transfusion consent form?

363
00:26:39,440 --> 00:26:40,670
Where did it go?

364
00:26:46,980 --> 00:26:49,380
- Where did it go?
- What are you looking for?

365
00:26:49,450 --> 00:26:51,480
Ko Eun Seol's
blood transfusion consent form.

366
00:26:51,920 --> 00:26:53,980
I'm sure I left it right here.

367
00:26:54,550 --> 00:26:57,420
Oh no, it must've gotten mixed in
with the discharge papers.

368
00:26:57,420 --> 00:27:00,860
What? How could you give that
to the patient?

369
00:27:01,790 --> 00:27:04,090
(Patient is adopted.
Caution for blood transfusion)

370
00:27:04,090 --> 00:27:07,760
"Blood type mismatch with family."

371
00:27:14,300 --> 00:27:16,210
All done. Let's go.

372
00:27:21,340 --> 00:27:22,810
What's wrong, Eun Seol?

373
00:27:25,720 --> 00:27:26,750
Mom...

374
00:27:29,620 --> 00:27:31,250
Am I not your daughter?

375
00:27:36,390 --> 00:27:38,900
(Patient is adopted.
Caution for blood transfusion)

376
00:28:02,490 --> 00:28:03,490
I...

377
00:28:03,690 --> 00:28:05,590
I can't believe it, Mom.

378
00:28:06,560 --> 00:28:08,560
How could I not be your daughter?

379
00:28:09,360 --> 00:28:11,230
What do you mean
you're not my daughter?

380
00:28:11,530 --> 00:28:14,200
Eun Seol, you're my daughter.

381
00:28:14,330 --> 00:28:16,870
No matter what anyone says,
you're my daughter.

382
00:28:16,870 --> 00:28:20,440
You adopted me.
It says you didn't give birth to me.

383
00:28:20,500 --> 00:28:21,500
Eun Seol.

384
00:28:22,540 --> 00:28:23,670
What do I do?

385
00:28:24,470 --> 00:28:25,980
What am I supposed to do now?

386
00:28:29,450 --> 00:28:32,280
Calm down.
Calm down and listen to me.

387
00:28:33,250 --> 00:28:34,350
Look at me.

388
00:28:38,190 --> 00:28:39,690
I said, look at me.

389
00:28:44,660 --> 00:28:46,030
Nothing has to change, Eun Seol.

390
00:28:48,400 --> 00:28:49,600
I'm your mom,

391
00:28:50,530 --> 00:28:51,530
and you're my daughter.

392
00:28:52,370 --> 00:28:53,440
Do you understand?

393
00:28:55,570 --> 00:28:58,610
Answer me.
I asked if you understand.

394
00:29:03,950 --> 00:29:06,050
Then it's okay. We're good.

395
00:29:21,100 --> 00:29:22,200
Are you okay?

396
00:29:27,640 --> 00:29:29,410
There's a taxi. Let's take that one.

397
00:30:21,220 --> 00:30:25,200
(A Trap Called Desire)

398
00:30:26,360 --> 00:30:28,100
How am I supposed
to get her expelled?

399
00:30:28,100 --> 00:30:29,500
Manager Joo,
you're good at that sort of thing.

400
00:30:29,500 --> 00:30:31,470
I know what you're capable of,
so why play dumb?

401
00:30:31,800 --> 00:30:32,940
I warned you.

402
00:30:33,140 --> 00:30:35,270
Don't get any ideas about Seok Jin.

403
00:30:35,570 --> 00:30:39,110
No, Vice Principal Hwang,
it really wasn't me.

404
00:30:39,510 --> 00:30:41,440
If you can't even do that much,
are you even human?

405
00:30:41,680 --> 00:30:42,950
You're worse than an animal.

406
00:30:43,080 --> 00:30:45,780
What kind of person
was my birth mother?

407
00:30:46,350 --> 00:30:47,980
Then why did she abandon me?

408
00:30:48,150 --> 00:30:51,590
- Joo Ae Sook.
- I said it's Mi Ran, not Ae Sook.

409
00:30:52,290 --> 00:30:53,590
I had a baby?

410
00:30:54,190 --> 00:30:56,330
When? Where's your proof?

411
00:30:56,960 --> 00:30:58,960
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
